## Environment Variables

```typescript
// src/config/env.ts
export const env = {
  API_URL: import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL ?? "",
} as const;
```

Always use `import.meta.env.VITE_*` — never `process.env` in Vite.
Prefix all client-side env vars with `VITE_`.

